{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y对人物动机的因果解释略有压缩，尤其结尾没有像X那样明确交代即使一直没有新的亲近关系，他也愿意独自好好生活。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用【】突出每段叙事抓手，感受词又分批随音乐出现，观众不必同时处理一整列短词，边听边扫更容易跟上。它对音色、节奏、身体反应的描写也更具体，旧歌、舞步、摇篮曲等反复出现的线索增强了前后呼应。X的人物因果解释和最终独立生活的落点更完整，但综合实时观看体验，Y更容易让普通观众既抓住故事，又听出音乐情绪变化的细微层次。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0a0e61d4-0e51-4464-b9dd-8eb1b53ecdac", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T223908727347Z", "elapsed_seconds": 69.437, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T22:40:18.188113+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "08a039b51c3cfa1ece44cdd34b2d1efa4d62a60a7e1f315fa2de10d7470f92ff", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "ee